Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 23:34:48 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 5.10: muscle map, specific muscle parts, drag to
 reorder

- Exercise picker: Muscle dropdown plus an optional Specific part
  dropdown (16 groups and their parts, after MuscleWiki), with a
  tappable front and back body map beside them
- Picked exercises keep the chosen part; 33 new exercises for the new
  groups and part tags on many existing ones
- Muscles tab: weekly heat map on the body, tap for sets, kind note
  for muscles that have been quiet
- Drag (or arrows) to reorder exercises in routines and during a
  live workout; saved routines keep the new order on drop
- Adds dnd-kit

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
